This is a bug in from_to:

gen <- from_to(10, 60, function() -1, FALSE)
gen()
#> [1] 9

should be -1. But this is a pathological case (you are setting up a
generator to generate nothing). Could you please:

- share a more realistic case in which you get an additional arrival?
- open an issue on GitHub with both examples? (If you have an account
there; otherwise, I can do it myself).

Thanks for the report.

--
Iñaki Úcar

